  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "掘哇！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639854C7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿！之前去找超巨大掘掘兔時，\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳罩我一把。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563FFF014E4B524D53BB627E8D855DE859276398639851546642FF0C000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B37F6962114E00628A300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當時我只能在一旁看著\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和那傢伙對戰，但……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75766642621153EA80FD57284E0065C1770B8457000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C90A350A24F195C0D6230FF0C4F462026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那時我感覺到有一朵小小的火苗，\n就這麼在我心裡燃起了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A366426211611F89BA523067094E0067355C0F5C0F7684706B82D7FF0C000A5C3190199EBC572862115FC388E171C38D774E86300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想要變得像<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳那樣強！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F389818B8A5F9750CF00100003110000FF01014F6059B390A36A235F37FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在那之後我可拼命了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n身為一個訓練家，身為一個旅人，\n可以說我是從零再次出發。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572890A34E4B5F8C621153EF62FC547D4E86300200100001BE01000A8EAB70BA4E00500B8A137DF45BB6FF0C8EAB70BA4E00500B65C54EBAFF0C000A53EF4EE58AAA6211662F5F9E96F6518D6B2151FA767C300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！\n這次，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就和我對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF01000A90196B21FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C31548C62115C0D62305427FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳見識一下我那些\n孕育了超巨大牽絆的夥伴們！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189818B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3898B8B584E004E0B621190A34E9B000A5B5580B24E868D855DE85927727D7D46768459254F345011FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……哎呀，\n我這是興奮得發抖。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要對戰了，\n別客氣，儘管來告訴我。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654CE5440FF0C000A62119019662F8208596E5F97767C6296300200100001BE01000A7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D89815C0D62304E86FF0C000A52255BA26C23FF0C51187BA14F86544A8A346211300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看樣子<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳已經搞定對戰的準備囉？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B6A235B5000100003110000FF01014F6059B35DF27D93641E5B9A5C0D623076846E96509956C9FF1F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "搞定了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "641E5B9A4E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還沒搞定",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90846C92641E5B9A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很～好！\n那我們這就來開始吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88FF5E597DFF01000A90A36211501190195C314F86958B59CB5427300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇兔！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C75154FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們上囉……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150114E0A56C92026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超～～～巨大的～<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85FF5EFF5EFF5E5DE859277684FF5E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牽絆的<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "727D7D46768400100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好夥伴們！！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D59254F345011FF01FF01FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘掘兔，讓對手見識一下\n我們最巨大的牽絆吧！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639863985154FF0C8B935C0D624B898B8B584E004E0B000A6211501167005DE859277684727D7D465427FF01FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼樣！\n我可是捉了很多隻頭目來培育呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC6A23FF01000A621153EF662F63494E865F88591A96BB982D76EE4F8657F980B25462300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "頭目感覺就是洋溢著\n野生的力量……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "982D76EE611F89BA5C31662F6D0B6EA28457000A91CE751F7684529B91CF2026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說不定在遠古時代，\n到處都是頭目呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA4E0D5B9A5728906053E466424EE3FF0C000A5230865590FD662F982D76EE5462FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我是打定主意要去遼闊的世界闖闖，\n所以離開了出生長大的密阿雷。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671366211662F62535B9A4E3B610F898153BB907C95CA76844E16754C95D695D6FF0C000A62404EE596E2958B4E8651FA751F9577592776845BC6963F96F7300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但現在我又重新停留在這個城市，\n享受著新的發現、新的邂逅。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4673FE5728621153C891CD65B0505C755957289019500B57CE5E02FF0C000A4EAB53D7845765B07684767C73FE300165B0768490829005300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……而且啊，\n我恍然大悟了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026800C4E14554AFF0C000A6211604D71365927609F4E86300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管是陌生的國家，還是熟悉的城市，\n只要覺得是在旅行，那就是在旅行！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n重要的是能在那裡獲得什麼。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA1662F964C751F7684570B5BB6FF0C9084662F719F6089768457CE5E02FF0C000A53EA898189BA5F97662F572865C5884CFF0C90A35C31662F572865C5884CFF0100100001BE01000A91CD89817684662F80FD572890A388E173725F974EC09EBC300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我決定要繼續在密阿雷待上一陣子，\n享受我自己的旅行囉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116C7A5B9A89817E7C7E8C57285BC6963F96F75F854E0A4E0096635B50FF0C000A4EAB53D7621181EA5DF1768465C5884C56C9300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘哇。掘哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639854C73002639854C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳陪我對戰。\n總有一天，我會追上<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3966A62115C0D62303002000A7E3D67094E005929FF0C621167038FFD4E0A00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684300200100002011401260000",
